   Patch 1: patch1    ┃   Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the source
lines quoted in the patches.

═════════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                      *
═════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one number is an edit
both patches make: a new number means both
add it, an old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│d2/dup.c     ┃ old new│d2/dup.c
        │@@ void yy(vo┃        │@@
        │id)          ┃        │
